  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance expert DRRS-Team South Durban Basin 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the DRRS Team&apos;s intervention is the development of a roadmap to achieve a comprehensive flood resilience strategy for the South Durban Basin. The roadmap needs to assist the eThekwini Municipality and other key stakeholders to develop and implement a strategy to reduce the local and regional flood risk to a 100-year level.For the development of the roadmap, the DRRS Team will undertake several stakeholder meetings to understand the technical, financial and institutional situation on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
